  "question": "设 $f(x^{2} - 1) = \\ln \\frac{x^{2}}{x^{2} - 2}$ ，且 $f[\\varphi (x)] = \\ln x$ ，求 $\\int_0^2\\frac{\\varphi'(x)}{4 + \\varphi^2(x)}\\mathrm{d}x.$",
  "answer": "的瑕点，则",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "瑕点拆分",
    "换元定积分"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 求出 $\\varphi(x)$ 的表达式，再计算积分."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "因为 $f(x^{2} - 1) = \\ln \\frac{x^{2} - 1 + 1}{x^{2} - 1 - 1}$ ，所以 $f(x) = \\ln \\frac{x + 1}{x - 1}$ ，而 $f[\\varphi (x)] = \\ln \\frac{\\varphi(x) + 1}{\\varphi(x) - 1} = \\ln x$ ，得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {\\varphi (x) + 1}{\\varphi (x - 1)} = x \\Rightarrow \\varphi (x) = \\frac {x + 1}{x - 1}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$x = 1$ 是积分的瑕点，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {0} ^ {2} \\frac {\\varphi^ {\\prime} (x)}{4 + \\varphi^ {2} (x)} d x = \\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\frac {1}{2 ^ {2} + \\varphi^ {2} (x)} d \\varphi (x) + \\int_ {1} ^ {2} \\frac {1}{2 ^ {2} + \\varphi^ {2} (x)} d \\varphi (x) \\\\ = \\frac {1}{2} \\arctan \\frac {\\varphi (x)}{2} \\Bigg | _ {0} ^ {1} + \\frac {1}{2} \\arctan \\frac {\\varphi (x)}{2} \\Bigg | _ {1} ^ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} \\left(- \\frac {\\pi}{2} + \\arctan \\frac {1}{2}\\right) + \\frac {1}{2} \\left(\\arctan \\frac {3}{2} - \\frac {\\pi}{2}\\right) \\end{array}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "= \\frac {1}{2} (\\arctan 8 - \\pi).\n$$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "的瑕点，则",
    "techniques_used": [
      "瑕点拆分",
      "换元定积分"
    ]
  },
  "cdps": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "prompt": "本题用换元、分部还是瑕点拆分来计算反常积分？",
